Our solution will provide hospital staff with an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of supporting them in their clinical-administrative activities. The tool will facilitate access to information, improve the quality of written outputs, and reduce processing and documentation times. We will achieve this through our core approach of Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), which generates answers from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus.

